%% Logical view: components and data flow, independent of technology.
flowchart LR
  api_src[CFPB search API] --> reader[Source readers]
  csv_src[CFPB bulk CSV] --> reader
  reader --> clean[Clean: normalise, parse, mask PII, validate]
  clean -->|valid| upsert[Upsert by complaint_id]
  clean -->|rejected + reason| quality[Quality tracker]
  upsert --> store[(complaints)]
  clean --> quality
  quality --> runs[(ingest_runs)]
  store --> reports[Reports]
  runs --> reports
  reports --> http[Report API]
  http --> metrics[Metrics and alerts]
